# Security

Consolidated pointers; read the linked rules/skills for detail.

| Topic | Rule / doc |
| --- | --- |
| Tenant isolation, RLS | `workspace-scoping.mdc`, `workspace-scoping` skill |
| RBAC | `fastapi-jwt-auth`, `rbac-and-audit` skills |
| Sensitive values, logs, prompts | `pii-guard.mdc` |
| Postings / emails / pages as data | `untrusted-content.mdc` |
| No evasion, politeness | `job-site-access.mdc` |
| Truthful generated content | `truthful-content.mdc` |
| Prod deploy guard | `no-prod-deploy.mdc` (unlock: **applywave**) |
| Audit trail | `audit-logging` skill, `activity_log` on mutations |
| Claude credentials | Never accepted, stored, or relayed by the server (`docs/research/08-bring-your-own-claude.md`) |

Revoked or inactive memberships must fail auth even if the JWT is unexpired.
